[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/30.tres]马忠（东吴）[/font][/b]


[color=#000000]基本信息：[/color] 生卒年不详，字号不详，籍贯不详，东吴将领，[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "潘璋", "cat": "people"}]潘璋[/url][/color]部下司马


